HELLOX.EXE here - a relocated 16-bit .EXE.
  my code segment relocated to 05A4
  my data segment relocated to 056B
  my stack segment relocated to 056B
  a far call inside the image returned
  INT 21h/62h says my PSP is 055B
  INT 21h/48h with BX=FFFF says the biggest block is 0000
  four far pointers followed: one two three four
HELLOX.EXE exiting through AH=4Ch.
